      "SourceSection": "9.2: A Table of Numbers",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Notice that some values in the columns labeled \\(\\log_{10} x\\) are whole numbers, but most are decimals. Why do you think that is?",
      "SourceLessonArtifact": "src/Edulytics.Core/Curriculum/LessonContent/RichV2/us-ccss-hs-alg2-u04-l09.rich-lesson-v2.json",
